@baseUrl = http://localhost:5003/api
@accessToken = PASTE_FRESH_TOKEN_HERE

### Upload raw video (multipart)
POST {{baseUrl}}/media/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mediaType"

RawVideo
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="videoId"

00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ./sample-files/sample.mp4
------boundary--

### Upload channel avatar
POST {{baseUrl}}/media/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mediaType"

Avatar
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="channelId"

00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./sample-files/avatar.png
------boundary--